{"id":"7d6a515cab34a133","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-tagged-tree-serialization.md","title":"标签树的成对标记序列化","display":"df-tagged-tree-serialization — 标签树的成对标记序列化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-tagged-tree-serialization","aliases":["73-df-tagged-tree-serialization"],"display":"df-tagged-tree-serialization — 标签树的成对标记序列化","depends_on":["[[73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.3.3–5.3.4, print pp. 198–206; PDF pp. 220–228; local paired-tag word representation","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-tagged-tree-serialization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-tagged-tree-serialization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tagged-tree-serialization — 标签树的成对标记序列化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4863e6af7073a451\" href=\"?note=4863e6af7073a451\" title=\"73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar\">73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.3.3–5.3.4, print pp. 198–206; PDF pp. 220–228; local paired-tag word representation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T\">\\(C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=(D,\\ell)\">\\(t=(D,\\ell)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DTDTree}_{T,s,C}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{DTDTree}_{T,s,C}(t)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4863e6af7073a451\" href=\"?note=4863e6af7073a451\" title=\"73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar\">73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})\">\\(\\Sigma=\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ser}_t:D\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{Ser}_t:D\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 按下式沿有限树递归定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ser}_t(d)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{op}(\\ell(d))\\rangle\n\\left(\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}\\operatorname{Ser}_t(d\\langle j\\rangle)\\right)\n\\langle\\mathrm{cl}(\\ell(d))\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ser}(t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ser}_t(\\varepsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ser}_t(d)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{op}(\\ell(d))\\rangle\n\\left(\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}\\operatorname{Ser}_t(d\\langle j\\rangle)\\right)\n\\langle\\mathrm{cl}(\\ell(d))\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ser}(t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ser}_t(\\varepsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,s,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Ser}(t):\\operatorname{DTDTree}_{T,s,C}(t)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,s,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Ser}(t):\\operatorname{DTDTree}_{T,s,C}(t)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归沿有限树的真子树下降。起止标签类型分离，读取时用栈匹配开闭标记可唯一恢复有序树。文本标签本身被视为一个字符，而非真实 XML 字符串中的若干字符。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar","status":"resolved","id":"4863e6af7073a451","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar","status":"resolved","id":"4863e6af7073a451","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)$，$s\\in T$，$C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T$；$t=(D,\\ell)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{DTDTree}_{T,s,C}(t)$，见 [[73-df-regular-content-tree-grammar]]。$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma$，$\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})=\\varnothing$，$\\Sigma=\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})$。$d\\in D$；$\\operatorname{Ser}_t:D\\to\\Sigma^*$ 按下式沿有限树递归定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T","display":false},{"tex":"t=(D,\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DTDTree}_{T,s,C}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ser}_t:D\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ser}_t(d)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{op}(\\ell(d))\\rangle\n\\left(\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}\\operatorname{Ser}_t(d\\langle j\\rangle)\\right)\n\\langle\\mathrm{cl}(\\ell(d))\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ser}(t)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ser}_t(\\varepsilon).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,s,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{Ser}(t):\\operatorname{DTDTree}_{T,s,C}(t)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1992,"backlinks":[{"id":"15d956da84593c7c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(T)$，$s\\in T$，$C:T\\to\\mathsf{RegExp}_T$。$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma$，$\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})=\\varnothing$，$\\Sigma=\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{op})\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{cl})$；对应序列化见 [[73-df-tagged-tree-serialization]]。对每个 $a\\in T$ 固定 $N_a=(Q_a,T,\\delta_a,q_a,F_a)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_T$，且 $L(N_a)=⟦ C(a)⟧_T$。$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(V)$，$j:T\\hookrightarrow V$、$h:\\{(a,q):a\\in T,q\\in Q_a\\}\\hookrightarrow V$，$\\operatorname{ran}(j)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(h)=\\varnothing$，$\\operatorname{ran}(j)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(h)=V$，$V\\cap\\Sigma=\\varnothing$。"},{"id":"432c4bc700976332","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-tagged-tree-serialization|标签树的成对标记序列化]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["4863e6af7073a451","0a6da8c909717780"]}